[7:10p.m.] #Ajasa #Ekoro #TrafficUpdate 

Traffic is on the high side at Ekoro Junction inward Agbelekale, then better inward Ile Iwe where it get's a bit slow due to commercial activities and high influx of vehicles

Moving to Command is good, then to Ikola/Odo where it is a bit slow, after which it is good to Adefemi and slow till Church.

