[8:35p.m.] #AgegeMotorRoad #TrafficUpdate 

Traffic is good coming from Oshodi underneath the bridge to Brown junction, Bolade, Ladipo, Shogunle, PWD, Airport Bus stop, National, on to the Ikeja Overpass to Ajayi Farm and Ile-Zik.

Our Men are strategically located to ensure traffic is seamless.

